{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slimg chased by space pirates, is forced to land on a mysterious planet. In order to leave this planet, Slimg began his adventure on this planet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331120/extras/6617974dcd82eeb1ed24c97c31369c45.poster.avif?t=1760668427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331120/extras/6617974dcd82eeb1ed24c97c31369c45.webm?t=1760668427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The SR400 planet has a total of four regions with completely different styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sdog village: The creatures in sdog village love pumpkins, and there is a mysterious ability in the village that allows other creatures to freely grow and shrink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331120/extras/48a6faa02ec1eb5d40c3a9025f036f33.gif?t=1760668427\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331120/extras/48a6faa02ec1eb5d40c3a9025f036f33.poster.avif?t=1760668427\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rainforest: In the depths of the rainforest, there are several temples where a mysterious female warrior landed in a spaceship. Could this be the key to leaving this planet?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331120/extras/1374532f619f0adc92c9d4e086c76479.poster.avif?t=1760668427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331120/extras/1374532f619f0adc92c9d4e086c76479.webm?t=1760668427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volcano: The volcano, which had been dormant for a long time, began to erupt again, and the constantly falling boulders caused unbearable suffering to the creatures living there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331120/extras/345c77aad10ed313dfd395d0d49da8ca.poster.avif?t=1760668427\" width=650 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331120/extras/345c77aad10ed313dfd395d0d49da8ca.webm?t=1760668427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331120/extras/345c77aad10ed313dfd395d0d49da8ca.mp4?t=1760668427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Icefield: The rulers of the Icefield seem to control the entire planet, and all disasters seem to arise from it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331120/extras/a471010a1214d8bb16d08116da694f1e.poster.avif?t=1760668427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331120/extras/a471010a1214d8bb16d08116da694f1e.webm?t=1760668427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Eecrypt</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area has decryption elements that match its style, solving puzzles and obtaining items that make characters stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please help Slei Dog leave this planet and explore various regions to its fullest!</p>","background":"https://store.a